  "split_type": "combo",
  "rag_agent": "user_guide_agent",
  "rag_query": "What is KYC?",
  "operational_query": "list participants with pending KYC"
}
```

### Step 3 — Orchestrator handles both parts

**Part A — RAG:**
```
