## Key Takeaways From This Walkthrough

```
1. Planner reads context_registry EVERY turn
   → decides if it can reuse previous data
   → saves agent calls when possible

2. Agent boundaries are strict
   → vesting_agent never knows about participant data
   → grant_agent never calls vesting directly
   → orchestrator is the only one who sees the full picture

3. RAG registry makes Q4 routing automatic
   → "EPM lead" matches client_ops_agent triggers
   → no hardcoding needed
   → adding policy_agent tomorrow = just registry entry

4. Combo queries (Q3) always present RAG first, data second
   → user gets concept explanation + real data in one response

5. Context accumulates across turns
   → Q5 reuses employee_ids from Q1/Q2 without asking again
   → this is the conversational memory working
```